<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Teljoy issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Teljoy issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teljoy Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday that, further to an announcement on February 25, the unbundling of parent company Servgro was still continuing and could affect Teljoy's share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to continue exercising caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
